{"name":"-57-L3-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Saga_AVG_Day","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_AMB_Street","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Brown-colored canvas awnings litter this clearing in the middle of the forest like scattered coffee beans, and wispy plumes of smoke rise from them under the sun's baking. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You wouldn't have known that they held regular flea markets here if Lily hadn't dragged you along to take a look with her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Pretty lively, isn't it..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-170","spriteScale":"1.21"}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mhm! I'm surprised that a lot of these stalls are still around even after all these years."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-170","spriteScale":"1.21"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That stall sells delicious dried shredded squid. Want to get some for Tae and Romero?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-170","spriteScale":"1.21"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wow, the plushies here are so cute!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Every now and then, Lily's little head will pop out on the left side of the crowd and then the right."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lily, wait for me..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lily","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"70,-170","spriteScale":"1.21"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lily Hoshikawa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? What's that written there... Franchouchou?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You look where Lily is pointing. It's a stall selling grilled squid and it has a banner with a white background."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Fran... Ah, the rest of it is blocked.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You stand on your tiptoes and crane your neck to get a look, and it IS a Franchouchou banner! Looks like Franchouchou has quite a few fans."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lily, it's a Franchouchou—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You look down. All you see are unfamiliar faces, and your breath catches in your throat."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"10394","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lily? Lily, where are you?! Can you hear me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nobody answers your shouts except for a few curious glances that sweep across you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lily's a smart girl; she wouldn't have run off too far..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You ask the nearby stall owners one by one whether they've seen Lily."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Flower Stall Owner","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm, she seems familiar... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She was walking with a gigantic guy. He had a scar over his left eye and looked really scary, so I remembered him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Say what?! What kind of relationship did they have?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Flower Stall Owner","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, I couldn't say. In any case, they bought something to eat and went that way."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, thank you! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Come on, Lily, please be alright...","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_b","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],